        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
       },
       "reviewBody": "We are dumpling people! I like the chicken of course but we prefer mostly dumplings with chicken flavoring LOL! So this was absolutely perfect!! Of course, I think this is easy to make as little (or as many) dumplings as you prefer. So delicious and reminded me of home",
