        "name": "Desi"
       },
       "datePublished": "2026-01-25"
      },
      {
       "@type": "Review",
       "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
       },
       "reviewBody": "I cut the recipe in half for two people and thought this was much easier than the stove top recipes I have tried. This was my first time using frozen chicken breasts in the slow cooker and biscuits as dumplings. I would definitely make this again.",
       "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Rose"
       },
